# 4. Database (summary)

**DB:** MySQL (`multi-tenant-scale`)
Core tables (brief):

- tenants
- tenant_settings
- users (tenant_id NULL for superadmins, is_superadmin boolean)
- roles
- modules (menu items) with parent_id for submenu
- role_permissions (role_id, module_id, can_create, can_read, can_update, can_delete, can_view_all)
- user_roles
- support_tickets, support_replies, support_attachments
- audit_logs (old_values/new_values JSON)
- refresh_tokens
- reset_tokens
- login_devices
- system_settings

Add indexes on tenant_id, user_id, created_at and searchable fields (name, email, title).

